  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wilderness and Livelihood Development (WILD) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to ensure that Subsistence communities in wildlife-agriculture interface areas have increased incomes and greater food security from sustainable wildlife-based land-use and tourism enterprises integrated with their current land-use activities, backed by sound training, extension and strategy reform</narrative>
